From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:23:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] j604: give the microphone macOS's tonal balance

macOS's general microphone path on the J604 shapes the beamformer's
output: level below about 300 Hz, 4 dB down by 1 kHz and about 4.5 dB
down above that, all the way to 20 kHz. Our graph ends with the beam,
the boosts and a high-pass, so it sounds thinner than macOS on the same
array.

End the graph with one low shelf of our own, +4.5 dB at 490 Hz (Q 0.6),
which follows that shape within 0.6 dB rms from 100 Hz to 16 kHz. A low
shelf rather than a high shelf of -4.5 dB keeps the level of speech as
it was.
---
 README.J604.md     | 10 ++++++++++
 firs/j604/mic.json | 13 ++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 22 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/README.J604.md b/README.J604.md
index 2202ff3..e850422 100644
--- a/README.J604.md
+++ b/README.J604.md
@@ -93,3 +93,13 @@ direction are used; no Apple coefficients are added.
 
 This needs triforce-lv2 with the steering phase fix (0.3.2-1.611): older
 builds compute almost the same steering vector for every direction.
+
+## Microphone tone
+
+macOS's general microphone path for this board weights the beam's output
+with a smooth curve: level below about 300 Hz, 4 dB down by 1 kHz and about
+4.5 dB down from there to 20 kHz. The graph ends with our own filter of that
+shape, one low shelf of +4.5 dB at 490 Hz (Q 0.6), which follows that curve
+within 0.6 dB rms from 100 Hz to 16 kHz. It lifts the lows rather than
+cutting the rest, so the level of speech stays where it was. No Apple
+coefficients are added.
diff --git a/firs/j604/mic.json b/firs/j604/mic.json
index 166fb0c..f425594 100644
--- a/firs/j604/mic.json
+++ b/firs/j604/mic.json
@@ -68,6 +68,16 @@
                     "Q": 0.707
                 }
             },
+            {
+                "type": "builtin",
+                "label": "bq_lowshelf",
+                "name": "tone",
+                "control": {
+                    "Freq": 490,
+                    "Gain": 4.5,
+                    "Q": 0.6
+                }
+            },
         ],
         "links": [
             { "output": "mixL:Out", "input": "bf:in_1" },
@@ -76,6 +86,7 @@
             { "output": "bf:out", "input": "boostInter:In 1" },
             { "output": "boostInter:Out", "input": "boostFinal:In 1" },
             { "output": "boostFinal:Out", "input": "hpf:In" },
+            { "output": "hpf:Out", "input": "tone:In" },
         ],
         "inputs": [
             "mixL:In 1",
@@ -83,7 +94,7 @@
             "mixO:In 1",
         ],
         "outputs": [
-            "hpf:Out"
+            "tone:Out"
         ],
     },
     "capture.props": {
